---
import BookingStatus from '../../BookingStatus.astro';
---

<section class="inner-hero" aria-labelledby="contact-title"><div class="section-shell inner-hero__grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONTACT</p><h1 id="contact-title">Let's get<br /><span>you moving.</span></h1></div><div class="inner-hero__aside"><p class="hero-lede">Have a question about physical therapy, your recovery, or whether Forge is the right fit for you? We're here to help.</p><p>If you're ready to get started, the fastest way is to book an evaluation.</p><BookingStatus /></div></div></section>

  <section class="contact-main surface-light" aria-labelledby="contact-form-title"><div class="section-shell contact-main__grid">
    <div class="contact-form-copy"><p class="eyebrow">HAVE A QUESTION?</p><h2 id="contact-form-title">We'd love to hear from you.</h2><p>Whether you're not sure where to start, have a question about services, or want to learn more about how Forge works, send us a message.</p><p class="contact-privacy">Please do not include sensitive medical information in this form.</p></div>
    <form class="contact-form" name="contact" method="POST" data-netlify="true" aria-label="Contact Forge form">
      <label>Name<input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your Name" required /></label>
      <label>Email<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="Your Email" required /></label>
      <label>Phone<input type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="Your Phone" /></label>
      <label class="contact-form__full">What can we help you with?<select name="interest"><option value="">Select an option</option><option>I'm interested in physical therapy</option><option>I'm recovering from surgery</option><option>I'm interested in sports rehabilitation</option><option>I'm interested in strength &amp; performance</option><option>I have a question about pricing</option><option>I'm not sure if Forge is right for me</option><option>Other</option></select></label>
      <label class="contact-form__full">Message<textarea name="message" rows="6" placeholder="Tell us a little about what you're looking for" required></textarea></label>
      <div class="contact-form__full contact-form__submit"><button type="submit">Send Message</button><span>Your information is secure and will only be used to contact you regarding your inquiry.</span></div>
    </form>
  </div></section>

  <section class="contact-direct" aria-labelledby="direct-title"><div class="section-shell"><header class="interior-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PREFER TO REACH OUT DIRECTLY?</p><h2 id="direct-title">Choose the way that works for you.</h2></div><p>Brandon hasn't supplied the final clinic phone, email, location, or hours yet, so the demo keeps those values explicit instead of inventing them.</p></header><div class="contact-cards"><article><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold-bright)" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="contact-icon"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg><h3>Phone</h3><p>Phone number coming soon</p></article><article><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold-bright)" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="contact-icon"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline></svg><h3>Email</h3><p>Email address coming soon</p></article><article><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold-bright)" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="contact-icon"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg><h3>Location</h3><p>Forge Rehab &amp; Performance</p><p>Gym name coming soon</p><p>Address coming soon</p></article><article><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--gold-bright)" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="contact-icon"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg><h3>Hours</h3><p>Hours coming soon</p></article></div></div></section>

  <section class="contact-location surface-light" aria-labelledby="location-title"><div class="section-shell contact-location__grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">VISIT FORGE</p><h2 id="location-title">Your rehab. Your training environment.</h2><p>Forge Rehab &amp; Performance is located inside the clinic's partner gym, giving you access to a real training environment where rehabilitation can progress naturally from recovery to strength and performance.</p><p class="contact-location__placeholder">Map and directions will update once the gym name and address are finalized.</p></div><div class="map-embed-wrapper" aria-label="Map location"><iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m12!1m3!1d200000!2d-95!3d38!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1" width="100%" height="100%" style="border:0;" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" title="Google Map location for Forge (address pending)"></iframe></div></div></section>

  <section class="home-close" aria-labelledby="contact-close-title"><div class="section-shell home-close__grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">NOT SURE IF FORGE IS RIGHT FOR YOU?</p><h2 id="contact-close-title">That's okay.</h2><p>You don't need to know exactly what service you need before reaching out. Start with a conversation or book an evaluation, and we'll figure out the right next step together.</p></div><BookingStatus /></div></section>
